# Anthropology and Interdisciplinarity

**Authors:** Strathern, Marilyn

## Abstract
Professor Marilyn Strathern in conversation with Professor Ludmilla Jordanova in the series &quot;Conversations at CRASSH&quot; (Centre for Research in the Arts, Social Sciences and Humanities, at Cambridge University), an extensive two-year programme convened by Ludmilla Jordanova as CRASSH Director. Professor Strathern speaks on &quot;Why anthropology matters&quot; at the 2005 Cambridge University International Summer School. (Contains 2 notes.)

